\par\par \b \uc2 S.Korea won reaches 7-mth high vs dlr on exporters   \b0\par\par\uc2 532 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Juli 2007\par 02:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates to close)   \par \par \uc2 SEOUL, July 19 (Reuters) - The South Korean won <KRW=> hit a seven-month high against the dollar on Thursday as exporter deals prompted market players to clear dollar-long positions.   \par \par \uc2 A broad fall in the dollar also provided support for the won, after Federal Reserve Chairman Ben Bernanke said U.S. housing market woes could threaten an expected recovery in the world's top economy.   \par \par \uc2 But worries about possible dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  authorities and sustained massive foreign sales in the local stock market cut gains in the won.   \par \par \uc2 The won was last quoted at 915.8/6.1 per dollar, compared to its previous closing bid of 915.9. It touched a session high of 914.4, its strongest since 914.2 on Dec. 8, 2006.   \par \par \uc2 "Investors had to clear dollar-long positions to cut losses as supplies related to foreign stock sales were not as great as expected and as exporters kept up demand," said a foreign bank dealer.   \par \par \uc2 He said market players had held the long positions in the U.S. unit too long due to expectations for won offers from foreign equity investors.   \par \par \uc2 Dollar-spot trading volume reached about $10.33 billion, the Seoul Money Brokerage Services Ltd. and  \uc2 Korea Money Broker Corp.\uc2  said, well above an average of $7.29 billion for this year.   \par \par \uc2 Foreign investors sold a net 447 billion won worth of shares Seoul's main stock market, after selling a combined net 1.33 trillion won in the prior three sessions.   \par \par \uc2 The benchmark KOSPI <.KS11> ended up 0.37 percent.   \par \par \uc2 Some \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market players said foreign investors may buy South Korean assets again rather than converting the proceeds for repatriation.   \par \par \uc2 Exporters kept supporting the won as South Korea said on Thursday that overseas sales from Asia's fourth-largest economy rose 26.2 percent in the first 17 days of July from a year ago.   \par \par \uc2 Danaos Corp.\uc2  , a Greek shipping line, said it would acquire five 1997 built containerships built by  \uc2 Hyundai Heavy Industries Co. Ltd.\uc2  for more than $150 million. [ID:nBNG107367]   \par \par \uc2 But investors remained wary of dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  after Vice Finance Minister Kim Seok-dong warned against speculation in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. [ID:nSEO145307]   \par \par \uc2 However, authorities were not spotted buying dollars, dealers said.   \par \par \uc2 On the corporate front, South Korea's  \uc2 Honam Petrochemical Corp.\uc2  said it will invest $390 million in a petrochemical plant project in Qatar. [ID:nSEO165193]   \par \par \uc2 The yen <JPY=> was at 121.81/85 per dollar versus 121.87/89 in late New York trade on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 Fed chief Bernanke told Congress on Wednesday housing market woes could dampen an expected pickup in U.S. economic growth, but he restated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's main worry is inflation. [ID:nN18243034]   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                      0710 GMT     0243 GMT   prev close\par  Won <KRW=>            915.8/6.1    915.4/5.7        915.9\par  Yen/won <JPYKRW=R>    7.5158/89   7.5037/109       7.5148\par  KOSPI <.KS11>          1,937.90     1,935.86     1,930.70\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-KOREA-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070722e37j0000b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
