2 The Federal Reserve on Thursday held benchmark U.S. interest rates steady at 5.25 percent and, while nodding to a recent easing in core inflation, restated that inflation is in its top concern. [ID:nN28273588]   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                        0315 GMT     0025 GMT   prev close\par  Won <KRW=>              925.5/6.3    926.2/7.1        926.5\par  Yen/won <JPYKRW=R>     7.5099/142   7.5142/237       7.5221\par  KOSPI <.KS11>            1,757.79     1,760.71     1,751.75\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-KOREA-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070702e36t0001h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
